Smart Employee Workplace & Project Collaboration Platform

About the Project

An intelligent workplace platform that connects employees, workplace services, and project collaboration in one application. It helps employees discover colleagues, understand project responsibilities, and identify people with the right skills.

Problem Statement

Employee information, project assignments, and workplace services are often spread across different tools. Our platform aims to centralize this information and make collaboration easier.

Key Features

- Employee dashboard and work status
- Employee directory and skill search
- Project and team mapping
- AI-powered employee matching
- Task progress and team analysis
- Desk and cab booking
- Office event notifications

AI Integration

The AI component helps understand project requirements and identify relevant skills. A matching algorithm compares these requirements with employee profiles to recommend suitable team members.

Technology Stack

- Frontend: React+Vite+TypeScript
- Backend: Python+FastAPI+Uvicorn
- AI: Gemma 4 E4B
- Database: JSON seed data,no database initially

How It Works

1. Employee profiles contain skills, experience, and roles.
2. A manager enters project requirements.
3. AI identifies the required skills.
4. The matching algorithm compares requirements with employee profiles.
5. The platform recommends suitable employees.

Future Enhancements

- Real-time team communication
- Advanced project analytics
- Improved skill gap analysis
- Integration with workplace tools

Expected Impact

The platform aims to improve employee collaboration, simplify workplace activities, and help managers identify suitable team members more efficiently.
